/*
Artistic Statement:

My goal was to show the stark increase in the average distance to abortion facilities in some states after Roe v. Wade was
overturned. In order to do this, I played with the idea of small multiples, where each state was represented by a circle
that was geographically positioned close to where it was in the real-world. Then, I used visual hierarchy in the color and 
radius of the circles in order to highlight the huge increase in distance.

To demonstrate a progression over time, I created two modes:
	1. An animated progression that would automatically advance the year so users could get a seamless high-level overview.
		- note the slight pause in 2022 to emphasize when Roe v. Wade was overturned
	2. Manual control over the slider to get more nuanced/slower information

Lastly, clicking on the individual states gives more information about individual states and their distances. This information
box also maintains the visual hierarchy by using the same colors for the background fill of the rectangle.

*/

